- Repository: https://github.com/simonmeusel/MuteSpotifyAds
- Author: Simon Meusel

Intermediate fork:
- Repository: https://github.com/MikeWLloyd/MuteSpotifyAds
- Maintainer: MikeWLloyd contributors

