Fork status:
- The upstream project is archived.
- The MikeWLloyd fork contains modifications for compatibility with current macOS
  versions, build updates, and release/distribution maintenance.
- This fork renames the application to Mutefy as of version 2.0.0 and adds filler
  music playback, fade in/out, an ad-detection state machine with entry debounce and
  a safety ceiling, crash recovery of the pre-mute volume, a fallback poll, a settings
  window, Korean localisation, an open-at-login option and a diagnostic log.

Third-party code incorporated:
- AdStateMachine.swift and the behaviour of FillerPlayer.swift are ported from the
  Windows build of Mutefy (https://github.com/countnine/mutefy), which is likewise
  licensed under GNU General Public License v3.0. No relicensing was involved.

